# Kloudify — repo base MUST stay pure.
# A fresh `git clone kloudify` must yield the PRODUCT only: no session
# state, no personal notes, no project-specific data. Everything that
# accumulates during use of Kloudify lives outside the versioned tree.
#
# Rule of thumb: if a file grows or changes just because you *used*
# Kloudify (instead of *developed* it), it belongs here.

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Personal / environment overrides
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.antigravity/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Runtime state (never versioned — volatile, per-session, per-project)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.claude/logs/
.claude/agent-memory/
.claude/backups/
.claude/hooks/__counter

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Session context & personal working notes
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# These are "the developer's mind during a session" — they must never
# leak from one clone to another. The base repo must be empty of them.
.claude/memory.md
.claude/knowledge-base.md
.claude/knowledge-nominations.md
.claude/reports/
.claude/plans/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Project workspace (local to whichever project uses Kloudify)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# These files exist only in real project deployments of Kloudify,
# never in the base repo. Their presence in a clone of the base would
# contaminate the fresh deployment with stale notes from development.
Daily Notes/
Scratchpad.md
Task Board.md
__NEEDS_ONBOARD

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Python
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Virtual environments
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.venv/
venv/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Environment & secrets
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.env
*.pem
*.key

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IDE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Testing & coverage
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Docker volumes (local data)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
pgdata/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Playwright MCP artefacts (screenshots, console logs, yaml snapshots)
# left behind by browser automation sessions during dashboard testing.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.playwright-mcp/
dashboard-*.png
# package.json is created by the Playwright MCP server on first run
# for its own JS environment — it does not belong to trdex.
package.json
package-lock.json